  <trk>
    <name>Wander round Ayr, Blue Bonnet Trail, Coastal Path</name>
    <desc>A walk from Ayr seafront to follow Blue Bonnet trail, old railway line fron Burns visitor centre, returning on the Ayrshire Coastal Path.</desc>
